{"id":"wb-7-1196","name":"彰德府城隍庙","retrievedAt":"2026-11-06T11:54:03+00:00","status":"ready","title":"彰德府城隍庙","text":"彰德府城隍庙位于中华人民共和国河南省安阳市文峰区鼓楼东街6号，相传始建于金朝初年，明洪武二年（1369年）、景泰五年（1454年）重修。1982年安阳市政府进行重修，后辟为安阳市民间艺术博物馆。2013年3月5日公布为第七批全国重点文物保护单位。彰德府城隍庙坐北向南，占地面积6773平方米，建筑面积2792平方米。","shortened":false,"sourceUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E5%BD%B0%E5%BE%B7%E5%BA%9C%E5%9F%8E%E9%9A%8D%E5%BA%99","revisionId":89830406,"revisionUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?oldid=89830406","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/","authors":"维基百科贡献者","matchEvidence":"名称与地理坐标一致","image":{"path":"assets/wikipedia/1e65d5fe3deb71e25c9e2b85.jpg","title":"The_Temple_of_the_Town_Deity_in_Zhangde_Prefecture_03_2025-09.jpg","sourceUrl":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:The_Temple_of_the_Town_Deity_in_Zhangde_Prefecture_03_2025-09.jpg","originalUrl":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/f/fb/The_Temple_of_the_Town_Deity_in_Zhangde_Prefecture_03_2025-09.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=original","author":"猫猫的日记本","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0","caption":"​安阳市文峰区彰德府城隍庙，牌坊南面。","width":320,"height":213}}